WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.166 --> 00:00:12.500
<b>I have often wondered about the people</b>

2
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.583
<b>who settled the land here first.</b>

3
00:00:20.958 --> 00:00:24.791
<b>To come to Iceland and experience the nature</b>

4
00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:29.708
<b>as dramatic as it is.</b>

5
00:00:33.458 --> 00:00:37.250
<b>To settle, live here and establish yourself</b>

6
00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:40.625
<b>in a way so that it’s possible to survive. </b>

7
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:51.041
<b>It would have definitely been spectacular to see </b>

8
00:00:51.041 --> 00:00:56.625
<b>all the waterfalls, the mountains, the geothermal areas...</b>

9
00:00:57.083 --> 00:01:00.166
<b>but I can’t imagine that it would have been easy.</b>

10
00:01:07.125 --> 00:01:13.041
<b>I have never needed to settle land, or cultivate food</b>

11
00:01:13.041 --> 00:01:16.333
<b>to survive or provide for my family. </b>

12
00:01:16.583 --> 00:01:18.916
<b>Not in that way</b>

13
00:01:20.458 --> 00:01:25.291
<b>But I have gone through other difficulties in life.</b>

14
00:01:25.291 --> 00:01:28.250
<b>I think that that is common for most people</b>

15
00:01:28.958 --> 00:01:36.375
<b>Maybe similar to what Ingólfur Arnarson and Hrafna-Flókia</b>

16
00:01:36.375 --> 00:01:41.750
<b>and their people went through thousands of years ago.</b>

17
00:01:43.583 --> 00:01:47.041
<b>My name is Brynjólfur Víðir Ólafsson</b>

18
00:01:47.041 --> 00:01:49.875
<b>and I’m a member of the</b>
<b>Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints</b>

19
00:01:51.375 --> 00:01:55.041
<b>I grew up in Iceland in Hafnarfjörður</b>

20
00:01:55.041 --> 00:01:56.500
<b>and I was accustomed to playing in the lava</b>

21
00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:57.833
<b>when I was little</b>

22
00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:03.041
<b>and went out on Herjólfsgata,</b>

23
00:02:03.041 --> 00:02:14.000
<b>and in high school I took courses in mountaineering</b>

24
00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:20.125
<b>I never really thought about how great the nature was</b>

25
00:02:20.125 --> 00:02:26.000
<b>in Iceland, and how blessed I was to enjoy it.</b>

26
00:02:28.208 --> 00:02:33.458
<b>Since then I have lived in many different places,</b>

27
00:02:33.458 --> 00:02:36.291
<b>traveled far and wide</b>

28
00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:41.500
<b>it was last summer that we went to Iceland </b>

29
00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:44.416
<b>and got the opportunity to travel around a bit</b>

30
00:02:44.416 --> 00:02:46.333
<b>and enjoy the nature once again</b>

31
00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:52.750
<b>then I realized how lucky I really had been when I grew up</b>

32
00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:58.250
<b>to have the Icelandic nature just as my playground.</b>

33
00:03:00.041 --> 00:03:04.250
<b>I think that that is similar to the Gospel,</b>

34
00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:06.916
<b>to my faith in God and Jesus Christ</b>

35
00:03:08.791 --> 00:03:12.833
<b>that which you grow up with - I had it as a part of my</b>

36
00:03:12.833 --> 00:03:16.750
<b>childhood and was used to going to church</b>

37
00:03:17.125 --> 00:03:23.833
<b>and learning about Jesus, praying with my family,</b>

38
00:03:24.833 --> 00:03:26.625
<b>and reading the in the scriptures</b>

39
00:03:27.791 --> 00:03:31.041
<b>It was something that I maybe hadn’t thought a lot about,</b>

40
00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:34.500
<b>but to the same extent</b>

41
00:03:34.916 --> 00:03:40.916
<b>when I got older and went through life’s raging sea,</b>

42
00:03:40.916 --> 00:03:44.458
<b>have a family and travel between places</b>

43
00:03:45.083 --> 00:03:50.500
<b>one starts to get all sorts of thoughts and difficulties,</b>

44
00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:55.625
<b>"Am I enough for my family? Am I doing enough</b>

45
00:03:55.625 --> 00:04:01.083
<b>for my kids to raise them properly and be there for them</b>

46
00:04:01.083 --> 00:04:05.125
<b>and show them love and concern?"</b>

47
00:04:05.958 --> 00:04:10.208
<b>It was similar to the Icelandic nature,</b>

48
00:04:10.208 --> 00:04:13.625
<b>a new view of my faith in Jesus Christ.</b>

49
00:04:13.625 --> 00:04:18.166
<b>It has been something that I have gotten to rediscover</b>

50
00:04:18.166 --> 00:04:23.458
<b>in my grown-up years.</b>

51
00:04:26.208 --> 00:04:30.875
<b>I have often gotten to look to Christ</b>

52
00:04:30.875 --> 00:04:32.750
<b>and put my faith in Him</b>

53
00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:39.416
<b>and search in the scriptures, and have received answers</b>

54
00:04:39.416 --> 00:04:44.583
<b>to those challenges that I have gone through</b>

55
00:04:44.583 --> 00:04:47.708
<b>I have received guidance to help me to overcome</b>

56
00:04:47.708 --> 00:04:50.958
<b>those challenges and grow through that process.</b>

57
00:04:53.166 --> 00:04:58.583
<b>If you are searching for something and don’t know what it is</b>

58
00:04:58.583 --> 00:05:01.833
<b>some purpose in life or</b>

59
00:05:01.833 --> 00:05:04.583
<b>or you feel like you are lacking something</b>

60
00:05:06.166 --> 00:05:11.583
<b>then my advice would be to learn to pray,</b>

61
00:05:11.583 --> 00:05:13.125
<b>talk with God,</b>

62
00:05:13.125 --> 00:05:16.833
<b>and learn to recognize those feelings</b>

63
00:05:16.833 --> 00:05:19.708
<b>that he uses to talk to you.</b>

64
00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:24.333
<b>No matter how we look to Him,</b>

65
00:05:24.333 --> 00:05:32.875
<b>if we are sincere in heart, we can talk to Him </b>

66
00:05:32.875 --> 00:05:37.125
<b>and He listens to us and answers us and guides us </b>

67
00:05:37.125 --> 00:05:42.458
<b>He is ready to do that in order to help us realize</b>

68
00:05:42.458 --> 00:05:45.708
<b>what this life is all about</b>

69
00:05:46.375 --> 00:05:50.000
<b>Often it’s not in the way that I am expecting or</b>

70
00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:53.416
<b>exactly when I am expecting, but</b>

71
00:05:53.958 --> 00:05:58.375
<b>it’s unbelievable how when I look back on</b>

72
00:05:58.375 --> 00:06:01.041
<b> the most difficult times in my  life,</b>

73
00:06:02.291 --> 00:06:04.750
<b>I see that there is a larger purpose</b>

74
00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:07.500
<b>and that there is a plan</b>

75
00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:11.916
<b>and maybe more than I could see originally.</b>

76
00:06:14.833 --> 00:06:17.125
<b>I know that God is with us</b>

77
00:06:17.125 --> 00:06:18.708
<b>and He loves us</b>

78
00:06:19.625 --> 00:06:22.500
<b>and He wants us to be able to return back to Him,</b>

79
00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:25.041
<b>and He is ready to help us to do that.</b>

